1
00:00:12,150 --> 00:00:15,703
Observation log. Entry forty-two.

2
00:00:15,703 --> 00:00:19,255
I think... we've finally done it.

3
00:00:19,255 --> 00:00:25,607
Humanity no longer has to spend a third of its life asleep.

4
00:00:25,607 --> 00:00:30,344
A third of life — in darkness, in emptiness.

5
00:00:30,344 --> 00:00:33,035
Formula Z-zero-one works.

6
00:00:33,035 --> 00:00:34,650
It has to work.

7
00:01:16,150 --> 00:01:17,883
A week has passed.

8
00:01:17,883 --> 00:01:22,406
Subject number one has not slept for 168 hours.

9
00:01:22,406 --> 00:01:26,353
Productivity is up three hundred percent.

10
00:01:26,353 --> 00:01:32,224
Food intake is down threefold — he barely touches the steaks.

11
00:01:32,224 --> 00:01:35,304
Physical strength... incredible.

12
00:01:35,304 --> 00:01:39,539
Today he broke obsidian with his bare hands.

13
00:01:39,539 --> 00:01:42,426
Faster than a diamond pickaxe.

14
00:01:42,426 --> 00:01:46,950
I don't understand where the energy comes from.

15
00:02:31,150 --> 00:02:32,698
Entry... fifty.

16
00:02:32,698 --> 00:02:34,866
Something went wrong.

17
00:02:34,866 --> 00:02:44,671
Cell regeneration is out of control — tissue rebuilds faster than it breaks down, but... wrong.

18
00:02:44,671 --> 00:02:49,522
The brain no longer registers higher functions.

19
00:02:49,522 --> 00:02:52,722
He doesn't respond to commands.

20
00:02:52,722 --> 00:02:55,715
He doesn't react to his name.

21
00:02:55,715 --> 00:02:58,915
He doesn't eat what I give him.

22
00:02:58,915 --> 00:03:01,186
He just... watches me.

23
00:03:01,186 --> 00:03:03,250
For three hours now.

24
00:03:45,600 --> 00:03:47,542
Guards! GUARDS!

25
00:03:47,542 --> 00:03:53,627
Activate the isolation protocol! Seal Sector B!

26
00:03:53,627 --> 00:03:55,828
It... it got out!

27
00:03:55,828 --> 00:03:56,735
No! NO!

28
00:03:56,735 --> 00:03:57,900
[screams]

29
00:04:16,100 --> 00:04:22,400
Attention. Isolation protocol.

30
00:04:22,400 --> 00:04:25,600
Breach in Sector B.

31
00:04:25,600 --> 00:04:28,800
Attention. Breach in Sector B.

32
00:04:41,100 --> 00:04:44,381
We wanted to defeat sleep...

33
00:04:44,381 --> 00:04:48,600
...but instead, a nightmare woke up.

34
00:05:00,500 --> 00:05:07,500
Observation diary — entry 50. Project INSOMNIA / Formula Z-01. Sector B, Lab 3.

35
00:05:07,500 --> 00:05:12,000
If you are reading this — I didn't make it in time.

36
00:05:12,000 --> 00:05:20,000
Subject No.1 has not slept for 21 days. I was wrong. Sleep is not lost time. Sleep is when the body repairs what the day broke. I switched the repair off. And the body found another way.

37
00:05:20,000 --> 00:05:27,000
It regenerates. Always. But each time — a little worse. A little greener. A little less human.

38
00:05:27,000 --> 00:05:34,000
He no longer recognizes me. Yesterday I saw him looking at the guard by the door. The way I look at dinner.

39
00:05:34,000 --> 00:05:40,000
The formula spreads through a bite — the rat blood test confirmed it. Destroy all 49 previous entries. Destroy the samples.

40
00:05:40,000 --> 00:05:45,000
Destroy ME if you find me — I took half a dose three days ago. He feels nothing. He is just very, very tired. — Dr. E.

41
00:05:49,000 --> 00:06:07,000
DAY 1 // EVACUATION OF SECTOR B

42
00:05:51,000 --> 00:06:04,000
[distorted emergency radio broadcast]

43
00:06:07,000 --> 00:06:25,000
DAY 2 // QUARANTINE CHECKPOINT

44
00:06:25,000 --> 00:06:41,000
DAY 3 // THE CITY IS EMPTYING

45
00:06:41,000 --> 00:06:57,000
DAY 5 // FIRST BONFIRES

46
00:06:57,000 --> 00:07:15,000
DAY 7 // THEY WALK AMONG US

47
00:07:18,000 --> 00:07:36,000
PERSONNEL ARCHIVE // FATES: infected, at large, eaten, terminated, evacuated, unknown

48
00:08:12,000 --> 00:08:18,000
Sector B: destroyed under Protocol 9. City N: quarantine lifted on day 14. Early.

49
00:08:18,000 --> 00:08:24,000
Confirmed infected: 4,217. Trend: rising. Formula Z-01: stable. Incubation: up to 72 hours.

50
00:08:24,000 --> 00:08:30,000
Commission verdict: SUBJECT NOT CONTAINED. The project continues. Without us.

51
00:08:30,000 --> 00:08:42,000
A THIRD OF LIFE — a horror based on the files of Sector B

